The
reference source is the fixed indexed application-bundle path query
`kMDItemContentTypeTree == 'com.apple.application-bundle'`;

Apple's archived
[fsync manual](https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/System/Conceptual/ManPages_iPhoneOS/man2/fsync.2.html)
describes the OS-crash/power-loss gap of fsync alone;

The existing independent whole-design
review/earned-integration route supplies the basis for a separately chartered independent
acceptance owner's scope-preserving trust act under the delegation;

K287 owns
whole-k282 reconciliation/review/integration before k269 assigns the required named
owners;
